seContainerCpuShares\"\" is now replaced by \"\"-XX:ActiveProcessorCount=<value>\"\". It prevents out-of-memory errors in case a GC algorithm with high internal memory usage has been activated in small containers (< 4GB). See: ActiveProcessorCount  \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine\",1127\n742,\"--- Record 2611 ---\nComponent: Integration Advisor\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Neo\nTitle: Enable/Disable Proposal Service\nDescription: You can now control the collection of data for the Proposal service by enabling or disabling the service according to your requirements.  See: Settings  \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-07-14\nValid as Of: 2024-07-14\nVersion: 2405\n\n--- Record 2612 ---\nComponent: Integration Advisor\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Neo\nTitle: Software Version Update\nDescription:   SAP Integration Advisor: 1.88.*    Increment: 2405    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-07-14\nValid as Of: 2024-07-14\nVersion: 2405\n\n--- Record 2613 ---\nComponent: Integration Assessment\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Software Version Update\nDescription:     Integration Assessment: 1.29.*      Increment: 2405    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-07-14\nValid as Of: 2024-07-14\nVersion: 2405\n\n--- Record 2614 ---\nComponent: Migration Assessment\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New Rules Added\nDescription: The following rules have been added for Migration Assessment:      ICOInboundInterfaces: Count the number of inbound interfaces of an integration scenario.      ICOReceivers: Count the number of receivers of an integration scenario.      SenderFileContentConversion: Determine number of fields in which file content conversion is used.      ReceiverFileContentConversio